# Defiant Survivor, Survival: "At the beginning of your second main phase, if this creature is tapped, manifest dread." It is cast on turn 1
# with three Moxen (the hand is the first seven cards, so turn 3 draws the Island and the library top is Snapcaster Mage then Lightning
# Bolt), attacks on turn 3 (tapped), and at the second main phase Bot1 manifests dread (CR 701.62a): the Mage goes onto the battlefield
# face down as a 2/2 (CR 708.2a) and the Bolt into the graveyard. On Bot2's turn 4 the Survivor is still tapped, but it is not Bot1's
# second main phase (CR 603.2, "your"): nothing is manifested.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Defiant Survivor
Island x3
Island
Snapcaster Mage
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x14

